Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Different bound couplings", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"29e209c2-3f4e-b346-bdb2-57ca996ca894"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
10. Weak ZZ coupling of the two edge spins: eigenstate g sweep\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"fefdcfb3-4059-6548-aa6b-b3f488047036"],

Cell["\<\
This chapter adds new definitions only. Evaluate the unchanged definitions in \
sections 1-2 first; sections 3-9 and their computations can be skipped. The \
original site order, S=sigma/2, partial traces, entropy functions, symmetry \
splitting, diagonalization, MaTeX labels, and export helpers are reused. The \
shared helpers in 10.2 are also used by chapter 11. No earlier symbol is \
cleared or redefined.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"446ce75a-eb3a-6840-955d-7032164d5f5c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["10.1 Model and exact symmetry classification", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"2871e26a-b165-1342-99d9-d20d3f49b8c6"],

Cell["\<\
H_ZZ(g)=H_bulk+g(S_1^z S_2^z+S_(L-1)^z S_L^z),
H_bulk=J Sum_(i=2)^(L-2) [S_i^x S_(i+1)^x+S_i^y S_(i+1)^y+Delta S_i^z \
S_(i+1)^z].
The original edge bonds are REPLACED, not supplemented. There are L total \
spins, no attached spins, and no magnetic fields anywhere. g is an \
independent coupling in energy units, not the ratio g/J; weak coupling means \
|g| << |J|. Delta applies only to the middle XXZ bonds. Use L>=4 and J!=0.
Both edge z components commute with H_ZZ for every g: sA=S_1^z=+/-1/2 and \
sB=S_L^z=+/-1/2. The bulk magnetization mBulk=Sum_(i=2)^(L-1) S_i^z is \
independently conserved; m=sA+sB+mBulk is therefore redundant but retained as \
a useful label. Within a fixed edge block, the middle chain sees longitudinal \
boundary fields g sA and g sB; these come from the interactions, not from \
additional field terms.
Reflection R reverses the entire chain, and F=Product_i sigma_i^x flips every \
spin. Both commute with H for equal edge couplings and zero fields. R maps \
(sA,sB,mBulk) to (sB,sA,mBulk); F maps them to (-sA,-sB,-mBulk). They do not \
generally preserve an individually resolved edge block. The mutually \
compatible sector labels used below are (m,sA,sB,mBulk,r) when sA=sB, \
(m=0,sA,sB,mBulk=0,rf) when sA=-sB, and (m,sA,sB,mBulk) otherwise. Here r and \
rf are eigenvalues +/-1 of R and RF. These alternatives avoid projecting a \
noncommuting or nonpreserving charge into an edge block.
Before reflection/RF splitting, a nonempty edge block has dimension \
Binomial[L-2,(L-2)/2-mBulk]. R and F still identify equal spectra in the \
partner blocks, even when they cannot be used as labels there. All blocks are \
diagonalized independently; partners are only overlaid in the plots after \
comparing their spectra.
With the fixed edge labels, every eigenket has the form |sA> tensor \
|phi_bulk> tensor |sB>. Consequently S_(edges|bulk)=0 exactly for this chosen \
eigenbasis, for every g. Half-chain entanglement and computational-basis IPR \
can still vary. A superposition of exactly degenerate states from different \
edge blocks can have a different entropy; it is not the eigenbasis used here.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"bf7b65a5-aeb8-5642-b6dc-4ed48b5d9bc7"],

Cell["\<\
At g=0 both edges are free: independent rotations of each edge and additional \
middle-chain symmetries appear. The code refines the parent sectors with \
compatible bulk reflection/spin flip and Casimirs at this endpoint, then \
combines the resulting eigenpairs back into their unchanged parent labels for \
plotting. At Delta=+1 or -1 the decoupled bulk has ordinary or staggered \
SU(2), respectively. For g!=0 neither a ZZ-only nor an XY-only edge bond \
preserves the full-chain SU(2), even at Delta=+/-1, so the original \
homogeneous-chain S or staggered-S labels must not be assumed. The real \
Hamiltonians also admit complex conjugation K and physical spin time \
reversal; these antiunitary symmetries are not extra unitary sector labels. \
Odd-L time-reversal partners are represented by the opposite-m sectors. \
Special integrable limits may have further conserved quantities beyond the \
spin and spatial symmetries classified here.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5f1c7b54-384a-1845-9bdf-06e066e60dcf"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
10.2 Shared new helpers: input validation, observables, sweeps, and plots\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"83d39955-af62-3c48-8252-e55cda944565"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"check", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
       "xxzH", ",", "bondOp", ",", "siteOp", ",", "charges", ",", 
        "splitCharge", ",", "diagonalizeBlock", ",", "\n", " ", "eigenket", ",",
         "addEntropies", ",", "sectorTable", ",", "halfEntropy", ",", 
        "edgeEntropy", ",", "framePlot", ",", "tex", ",", "\n", " ", 
        "curveStyles", ",", "pointMarkers", ",", "newFolder", ",", "savePNG", 
        ",", "startKernels"}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
         RowBox[{"DownValues", "[", "#", "]"}], "]"}], ">", "0"}], "&"}]}], 
     "]"}], ",", "\n", 
    " ", "\"\<Evaluate the unchanged definitions in sections 1-2 \
first.\>\""}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
   RowBox[{
   "edgeModel", ",", "edgeBonds", ",", "edgeExtraCharges", ",", "edgeSplit", ",",
     "edgeRefine", ",", "\n", " ", "edgeSetup", ",", "edgeED", ",", 
    "edgePoint", ",", "edgeSweep", ",", "edgeSweepCheck", ",", "edgeLabel", ",",
     "\n", " ", "edgeMarkers", ",", "edgeGridNote", ",", "edgeCaption", ",", 
    "edgePanels", ",", "edgeSave", ",", "zzEdgeH", ",", "zzEdgeSpaces", ",", 
    "zzEdgeSetup", ",", "zzEdgeED"}], "]"}], ";"}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->\
"f2855367-07f6-a546-a8bd-fa9de953fb33"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "Reject", " ", "hidden", " ", "fields", " ", "instead", " ", "of", " ", 
    "silently", " ", "retaining", " ", "or", " ", "dropping", " ", 
    RowBox[{"them", "."}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"edgeModel", "[", "p_Association", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"l", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
          RowBox[{"p", ",", "\"\<L\>\"", ",", 
           RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
       "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"check", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"IntegerQ", "[", "l", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
           RowBox[{"l", ">=", "4"}]}], 
          ",", "\"\<The edge-coupling chapters require integer L>=4.\>\""}], 
         "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"check", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
              RowBox[{"p", ",", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"\"\<J\>\"", ",", "\"\<Delta\>\""}], "}"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<Parameter\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}], ",",
              "realQ"}], "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<J\>\"", "]"}], "!=", "0"}]}], ",", "\n", 
          "  ", "\"\<J and Delta must be finite real numbers, with \
J!=0.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"check", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
             RowBox[{"p", ",", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               
               RowBox[{"\"\<h\>\"", ",", "\"\<bLeft\>\"", 
                ",", "\"\<bRight\>\""}], "}"}], ",", "0"}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
              RowBox[{"#", "==", "0"}], "]"}], "&"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
          "  ", "\"\<These two chapters have no magnetic fields; \
h=bLeft=bRight=0.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"<|", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\"\<L\>\"", "->", "l"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<J\>\"", "->", 
           RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<J\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<Delta\>\"", "->", 
           RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<Delta\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<h\>\"", "->", "0"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<bLeft\>\"", "->", "0"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<bRight\>\"", "->", "0"}]}], "|>"}]}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], 
    ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
    "Use", " ", "the", " ", "old", " ", "xxzH", " ", "and", " ", "remove", " ",
      "exactly", " ", "its", " ", "two", " ", "original", " ", "edge", " ", 
     RowBox[{"bonds", "."}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"edgeBonds", "[", "p_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"l", "=", 
          RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", "x", ",", "y", ",", 
         "z", ",", "vxy", ",", "vzz"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"x", ",", "y", ",", "z"}], "}"}], "=", 
         RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "k", "]"}], "/", "2"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"k", ",", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"vxy", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"bondOp", "[", 
              RowBox[{"x", ",", "x", ",", "k", ",", "l"}], "]"}], "+", 
             RowBox[{"bondOp", "[", 
              RowBox[{"y", ",", "y", ",", "k", ",", "l"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"k", ",", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"1", ",", 
                RowBox[{"l", "-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";",
         "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"vzz", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"bondOp", "[", 
             RowBox[{"z", ",", "z", ",", "k", ",", "l"}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"k", ",", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"1", ",", 
                RowBox[{"l", "-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";",
         "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"<|", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\"\<Bulk\>\"", "->", 
           RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"xxzH", "[", "p", "]"}], "-", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<J\>\"", "]"}], 
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{"vxy", "+", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<Delta\>\"", "]"}], " ", "vzz"}]}], 
               ")"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<ZZ\>\"", "->", 
           RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", "vzz", "]"}]}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<Exchange\>\"", "->", 
           RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", "vxy", "]"}]}]}], "|>"}]}]}], "\n", 
      "]"}]}], ";"}]}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"e125872b-6bcd-5b41-aedd-\
1018c928a06f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Extra", " ", "charges", " ", "are", " ", "used", " ", "only", " ", "at", 
     " ", "the", " ", "exactly", " ", "decoupled", " ", "endpoint", " ", 
     "g"}], "=", "0."}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"edgeExtraCharges", "[", "p_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"l", "=", 
          RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", "qb", ",", 
         RowBox[{"q", "=", 
          RowBox[{"<|", "|>"}]}], ",", "sx", ",", "sy", ",", "sz"}], "}"}], ",",
        "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"qb", "=", 
         RowBox[{"charges", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
           RowBox[{"p", ",", 
            RowBox[{"<|", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<L\>\"", "->", 
              RowBox[{"l", "-", "2"}]}], "|>"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", 
        " ", 
        RowBox[{"sx", "=", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"siteOp", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "1", "]"}], "/", "2"}], ",", "1", ",",
             "l"}], "]"}], "+", 
          RowBox[{"siteOp", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "1", "]"}], "/", "2"}], ",", "l", ",",
             "l"}], "]"}]}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"sy", "=", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"siteOp", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}], "/", "2"}], ",", "1", ",",
             "l"}], "]"}], "+", 
          RowBox[{"siteOp", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}], "/", "2"}], ",", "l", ",",
             "l"}], "]"}]}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"sz", "=", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"siteOp", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "3", "]"}], "/", "2"}], ",", "1", ",",
             "l"}], "]"}], "+", 
          RowBox[{"siteOp", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "3", "]"}], "/", "2"}], ",", "l", ",",
             "l"}], "]"}]}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"KeyExistsQ", "[", 
           RowBox[{"qb", ",", "\"\<S2\>\""}], "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"AssociateTo", "[", 
           RowBox[{"q", ",", "\n", "  ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<BulkS2\>\"", "->", 
             RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"id", "[", "2", "]"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"qb", "[", "\"\<S2\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"id", "[", "2", "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";",
         "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"KeyExistsQ", "[", 
           RowBox[{"qb", ",", "\"\<StaggeredS2\>\""}], "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"AssociateTo", "[", 
           RowBox[{"q", ",", "\n", "  ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<StaggeredBulkS2\>\"", "->", 
             RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"id", "[", "2", "]"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"qb", "[", "\"\<StaggeredS2\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"id", "[", "2", "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";",
         "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"AssociateTo", "[", 
         RowBox[{"q", ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"\"\<EdgeS2\>\"", "->", 
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"sx", " ", ".", " ", "sx"}], "+", 
               RowBox[{"sy", " ", ".", " ", "sy"}], "+", 
               RowBox[{"sz", " ", ".", " ", "sz"}]}], ")"}]}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<EdgeZ2\>\"", "->", 
             RowBox[{"sz", " ", ".", " ", "sz"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<RBulk\>\"", "->", 
             RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"id", "[", "2", "]"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"qb", "[", "\"\<R\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"id", "[", "2", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<FBulk\>\"", "->", 
             RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"id", "[", "2", "]"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"qb", "[", "\"\<F\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"id", "[", "2", "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";",
         "q"}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Reuse", " ", "splitCharge"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"including", " ", "its", " ", "spin"}], "-", 
      RowBox[{"Casimir", " ", "label", " ", 
       RowBox[{"conversion", "."}]}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"edgeSplit", "[", 
      RowBox[{"s_", ",", "q_", ",", "name_", ",", "tol_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"alias", ",", "label", ",", "out"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"alias", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Switch", "[", 
          RowBox[{"name", ",", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<BulkS2\>\"", "|", "\"\<EdgeS2\>\""}], 
           ",", "\"\<S2\>\"", ",", "\"\<StaggeredBulkS2\>\"", 
           ",", "\"\<StaggeredS2\>\"", ",", "_", ",", "name"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"label", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Switch", "[", 
          RowBox[{
          "name", ",", "\"\<BulkS2\>\"", ",", "\"\<SBulk\>\"", 
           ",", "\"\<EdgeS2\>\"", ",", "\"\<SEdge\>\"", ",", "\n", 
           "  ", "\"\<StaggeredBulkS2\>\"", ",", "\"\<StaggeredSBulk\>\"", ",",
            "_", ",", "name"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"out", "=", 
         RowBox[{"splitCharge", "[", 
          RowBox[{"s", ",", "q", ",", "alias", ",", "tol"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"alias", "=!=", "name"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"out", "=", 
           RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
              RowBox[{"t", ",", 
               RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
                RowBox[{"t", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"<|", 
